      "text": "You can view additional details of the resource that contains sensitive data or that has vulnerabilities. The granular information about the resource allows you to quickly investigate and take the necessary action."
    },
    {
      "text": "To view the resource details:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Data Security > DSPM > Resource Inventory.",
